{
    "title": "6abc Philadelphia",
    "description": "Get breaking news alerts and watch Action News with the 6abc Philadelphia app. Stay updated on local news and AccuWeather, as well as national stories from Philadelphia's most trusted news source. Customize the app based on your interests. \r\n\r\nWATCH\r\n- Watch Action News Live on the 24/7 streaming channel\r\n- Find exclusive video clips and watch Action News on demand\r\n- Use the \u201cpicture in picture\u201d feature to watch live video while you use other apps on your phone\r\n\r\nEXPLORE\r\n- Search news topics using the explore section\r\n- Find a news story by entering a keyword into the search bar\r\n- Browse news by topic, including I-Team, Safety Tracker, Politics and more! \r\n\r\nWEATHER\r\n- Easily choose your locations to get hourly conditions and the 7-day forecast\r\n- StormTracker6 Radar maps along with detailed weather information\r\n- Get weather and traffic alerts for severe conditions so you\u2019re always up-to-date before you head out.\r\n\r\nMY NEWS\r\n- Stay informed on stories that matter to you by choosing topics you care about\r\n- \"My News\" builds a unique feed just for you based on the interests and locations you choose\r\n- Choose customized alerts for topics and locations you care about, from entertainment news to sports updates and everything in between.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get breaking news alerts and watch Action News with the 6abc Philadelphia app. Stay updated on local news and AccuWeather, as well as national stories from Philadelphia&#39;s most trusted news source. Customize the app based on your interests. <br><br>WATCH<br>- Watch Action News Live on the 24/7 streaming channel<br>- Find exclusive video clips and watch Action News on demand<br>- Use the \u201cpicture in picture\u201d feature to watch live video while you use other apps on your phone<br><br>EXPLORE<br>- Search news topics using the explore section<br>- Find a news story by entering a keyword into the search bar<br>- Browse news by topic, including I-Team, Safety Tracker, Politics and more! <br><br>WEATHER<br>- Easily choose your locations to get hourly conditions and the 7-day forecast<br>- StormTracker6 Radar maps along with detailed weather information<br>- Get weather and traffic alerts for severe conditions so you\u2019re always up-to-date before you head out.<br><br>MY NEWS<br>- Stay informed on stories that matter to you by choosing topics you care about<br>- &quot;My News&quot; builds a unique feed just for you based on the interests and locations you choose<br>- Choose customized alerts for topics and locations you care about, from entertainment news to sports updates and everything in between.",
    "summary": "Stream Action News and get customized breaking news and AccuWeather alerts.",
